will launch a raid to free them?


00:42:43.979 --> 00:42:45.647
Not a chance.


00:42:45.731 --> 00:42:47.482
The days of Entebbe
are long over.


00:42:47.566 --> 00:42:51.069
You're not to call the CIA,
FBI, Homeland Security


00:42:51.153 --> 00:42:53.739
