got a lot to talk about.


00:43:37.407 --> 00:43:39.159
Okay.


00:43:39.242 --> 00:43:40.869
Let's talk.


00:43:43.997 --> 00:43:45.540
Are you Hezbollah?


00:43:48.210 --> 00:43:49.836
Am I Hezbollah?


00:43:49.920 --> 00:43:51.755
