00:46:23.281 --> 00:46:25.075
Give him his tea.


00:47:40.900 --> 00:47:42.819
I'm gonna get you out of there.


00:47:42.902 --> 00:47:44.446
I'll get you out of there, Doug.


00:47:45.947 --> 00:47:47.967
Some bastard on the Internet
