00:50:07.630 --> 00:50:09.757
No! Don't let 'em take me!


00:50:09.841 --> 00:50:12.218
Don't let 'em take me!
Don't let 'em take me!


00:50:17.348 --> 00:50:19.392
Oh, shit!


00:50:21.644 --> 00:50:23.313
Somebody help! Somebody help.


