00:54:19.048 --> 00:54:20.466
Please come over here.


00:54:23.719 --> 00:54:27.557
In the name of God, I'm here
today with nice American lady.


00:54:27.640 --> 00:54:29.517
She's here in the
Islamic Republic


00:54:29.600 --> 00:54:32.645
