finding her husband.


00:54:32.728 --> 00:54:34.147
<i>We will assist her.</i>


00:54:34.230 --> 00:54:37.442
<i>At present, we do
not know where he is.</i>


00:54:37.525 --> 00:54:40.111
<i>Apparently, he
was on TV in Cairo.</i>


00:54:40.194 --> 00:54:42.405
What do you want from me?


00:54:52.206 --> 00:54:55.126
What do you want?!
What do you want?!


00:54:55.209 --> 00:54:56.836
<i>- What do you want?!
- He's an American</i>


00:54:56.919 --> 00:54:58.713
who has disappeared.


00:54:58.796 --> 00:55:00.465
Maybe he runs
away from his wife.


00:55:00.548 --> 00:55:03.050
